# Requirements

### H1: Half-strength c1 with a c3 sine gives a straight crawl of 0.3 to 0.5 m

WHEN c1 is held at -0.5 and c3 is a unit sine at 1.5 or 2 Hz, THE system SHALL end at x between 0.3 and 0.5 m with heading within 20 deg of zero.

```prediction
