s3 = 1
f = 1.5
```

Result (E1): all missed low for x. a1=-0.5, f=2: x -0.055, heading -7.7. f=1.5: x -0.023, heading -1.2. The body barely moved, so a1=-0.5 does not stroke forward at f 1.5-2.

